  "question": {
    "text": "The foci of the ellipse $\\frac{x^2}{16}+\\frac{y^2}{b^2}=1$ and the hyperbola $\\frac{x^2}{144}-\\frac{y^2}{81}=\\frac{1}{25}$ coincide. Then the value of $b^2$ is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\n9\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n1\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n5\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n7",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\frac{x^2}{144}-\\frac{y^2}{81}=\\frac{1}{25}$\n$\\mathrm{a}=\\sqrt{\\frac{144}{25}}, \\mathrm{~b}=\\sqrt{\\frac{81}{25}}, \\mathrm{e}=\\sqrt{1+\\frac{81}{144}}=\\frac{15}{12}=\\frac{5}{4}$\nFoci $=(3,0)$, focus of ellipse $=(3,0) \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{e}=\\frac{3}{4}$\n$b^2=16\\left(1-\\frac{9}{16}\\right)=7$"
  }
}